#: ../../source/docs/common-zeroonex6.rst:69 f404a882017641c4ad4fdec17f5baf34
msgid "RC Input"
msgstr "RC 输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-zeroonex6.rst:71 95e2548eaf91496393f5b975b7e9be58
msgid ""
"The remote control signal should be connected to the SBUS RC IN port or "
"DSM/PPM RC Port.It will support ALL unidirectional RC protocols. For FPort, "
"CRSF/ELRS, SRXL, etc. any UART can be used, see :ref:`common-rc-systems` for"
" more information."
msgstr ""
"遥控信号应连接到 SBUS RC IN 接口或 DSM/PPM RC 接口，支持所有单向 RC 协议。对于 FPort、CRSF/ELRS、SRXL "
"等协议，可使用任意 UART，详见 :ref:`common-rc-systems`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-zeroonex6.rst:74 30adfd1c17a7462a8dd8f341a6f67f8e
msgid "PWM Output"
msgstr "PWM 输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-zeroonex6.rst:76 10903ba80ca6454abbc2b17d60b5f42f
msgid ""
"The X6 flight controller supports up to 16 PWM outputs. First 8 outputs "
"(labeled 1 to 8) are controlled by a dedicated STM32F103 IO controller. The "
"remaining 8 outputs (labeled 9 to 16) are the \"auxiliary\" outputs. These "
"are directly attached to the STM32H753 FMU controller."
msgstr ""
"X6 飞控最多支持 16 路 PWM 输出。前 8 路输出（编号 1–8）由独立的 STM32F103 IO 控制器控制；其余 8 路输出（编号 "
"9–16）为「辅助」输出，直接连接到 STM32H753 FMU 控制器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-zeroonex6.rst:78 7c5f415fcec34845a8910442013ce942
msgid ""
"All 16 outputs support normal PWM output formats. All 16 outputs support "
"DShot, except 15 and 16. Outputs 1-8 supoort BiDirectional DShot."
msgstr ""
"所有 16 路输出支持标准 PWM 输出格式。除 15 和 16 路外，所有 16 路输出均支持 DShot。输出 1–8 支持双向 DShot。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-zeroonex6.rst:80 256d4398befa4bcf950120c26988144e
msgid "The 8 IO PWM outputs are in 4 groups:"
msgstr "8 路 IO PWM 输出分为 4 组："

#: ../../source/docs/common-zeroonex6.rst:82 226d2e0a450342ddb7660b24864a5b1e
msgid "Outputs 1 and 2 in group1"
msgstr "输出 1 和 2 为第 1 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-zeroonex6.rst:83 10dedc41cc874bd7a521901367a46cf8
msgid "Outputs 3 and 4 in group2"
msgstr "输出 3 和 4 为第 2 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-zeroonex6.rst:84 8c83773f95594f729773644993e2be02
msgid "Outputs 5, 6, 7 and 8 in group3"
msgstr "输出 5、6、7 和 8 为第 3 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-zeroonex6.rst:86 50ce668568fe41fc88fbf414b8089c84
msgid "The 8 FMU PWM outputs are in 4 groups:"
msgstr "8 路 FMU PWM 输出分为 4 组："

#: ../../source/docs/common-zeroonex6.rst:89 2988b1bda79a42ceb2864a7607008527
msgid "Outputs 9-12 in group1"
msgstr "输出 9–12 为第 1 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-zeroonex6.rst:90 c07bb27a3dcf4ac2a5d1013645f9c49d
msgid "Outputs 13 and 14 in group2"
msgstr "输出 13 和 14 为第 2 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-zeroonex6.rst:91 10f67bddf89d40c496c462da497d102e
msgid "Outputs 15 and 16 in group3 (PWM only)"
msgstr "输出 15 和 16 为第 3 组（仅 PWM）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-zeroonex6.rst:93 726e451888cb4a68a4a6866f973057ea
msgid ""
"Channels within the same group need to use the same output rate. If any "
"channel in a group uses DShot then all channels in the group need to use "
"DShot."
msgstr "同一组内的通道必须使用相同的输出速率。如果某组中任一通道使用 DShot，则该组中所有通道都必须使用 DShot。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-zeroonex6.rst:96 7157ab07369f4105b636dfc537c98590
msgid "GPIO"
msgstr "GPIO"

#: ../../source/docs/common-zeroonex6.rst:98 3e2d75a5dd9841fd828a9f05ddd1aba1
msgid ""
"All PWM outputs can be used as GPIOs (relays, camera, RPM etc). To use them "
"you need to set the output’s ``SERVOx_FUNCTION`` to -1. The numbering of the"
" GPIOs for PIN variables in ArduPilot is:"
msgstr ""
"所有 PWM 输出均可用作 GPIO（继电器、相机、转速等）。使用时需将对应输出的 ``SERVOx_FUNCTION`` 设置为 "
"-1。ArduPilot 中 PIN 变量的 GPIO 编号如下："

#: ../../source/docs/common-zeroonex6.rst:123 540d93d07fa34a2cbea35f8646ec62a1
msgid "Battery Monitoring"
msgstr "电池监控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-zeroonex6.rst:125 4766fbc22add46a5875254f3fd12fe03
msgid ""
"The X6 flight controller has two six-pin power connectors, supporting CAN "
"power modules. These are set by default in the firmware and shouldn't need "
"to be adjusted."
msgstr "X6 飞控具有两个六针电源接插件，支持 CAN 电源模块。固件已默认配置，通常无需调整。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-zeroonex6.rst:129 fff81c079ab44aca96a08dc28974d1be
msgid "Compass"
msgstr "罗盘"

#: ../../source/docs/common-zeroonex6.rst:131 81637e2b49464dabb52c958c2425ff2a
msgid ""
"The X6 flight controller built-in industrial-grade electronic compass chip "
"RM3100. Users may want to disable this and use an external compass in case "
"of motor noise interference."
msgstr "X6 飞控内置工业级电子罗盘芯片 RM3100。如受电机噪声干扰，用户可禁用内置罗盘并改用外置罗盘。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-zeroonex6.rst:134 a03c0bbb3bda472b9d1dab9f4cb5ca3d
msgid "Analog inputs"
msgstr "模拟输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-zeroonex6.rst:136 01ed5711392e45d5a342cd79761df7d0
msgid "The X6 flight controller has 3 analog inputs."
msgstr "X6 飞控共有 3 路模拟输入。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-zeroonex6.rst:138 381c39a65584471190099b055a862f76
msgid "ADC Pin12 -> ADC 6.6V Sense"
msgstr "ADC Pin12 -> ADC 6.6V 采样"

#: ../../source/docs/common-zeroonex6.rst:139 cf6ed84726894762bba432096da7cd0e
msgid "ADC Pin13 -> ADC 3.3V Sense"
msgstr "ADC Pin13 -> ADC 3.3V 采样"

#: ../../source/docs/common-zeroonex6.rst:140 089e6bc678ba451981e9b38ff118c307
msgid "RSSI input pin = 103"
msgstr "RSSI 输入引脚 = 103"

#: ../../source/docs/common-zeroonex6.rst:143 8571146bcc9442dd868e6cf712c85ce3
msgid "5V PWM Voltage"
msgstr "5V PWM 电压"

#: ../../source/docs/common-zeroonex6.rst:145 bf0fd854a57848969aff8980c63ff36b
msgid ""
"The X6 flight controller supports switching between 5V and 3.3V motro/servo "
"output levels. Switch the output pulse level by configuring parameter "
":ref:`BRD_PWM_VOLT_SEL<BRD_PWM_VOLT_SEL>`. Set 0 for 3.3V and 1 for 5V "
"output."
msgstr ""
"X6 飞控支持在 5V 和 3.3V 电机/舵机输出电平之间切换。通过配置参数 "
":ref:`BRD_PWM_VOLT_SEL<BRD_PWM_VOLT_SEL>` 切换输出脉冲电平，设置 0 为 3.3V 输出，设置 1 为 5V "
"输出。"

